{"seq":13,"slug":"web3d-visualization","title":"Web3D 与可视化","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization","rating":{"composite":3.53,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introMarkdown":"# Web3D 与可视化 简介\n\nWeb3D 与可视化是前端开发中极具创造力和技术深度的方向。从数据驱动的图表仪表盘到沉浸式的三维交互场景，浏览器已经成为强大的图形渲染平台。本知识库系统梳理 Web 图形技术栈的核心原理与工程实践，帮助开发者构建高性能、可交互的可视化应用。\n\n本知识库适合具备 JavaScript 和前端基础的中高级开发者，尤其是希望在数据可视化、三维渲染、图形引擎等方向深入发展的工程师。无论你是要为业务系统搭建数据大屏，还是要开发 WebGL 驱动的交互产品，都能从中获得系统性的知识支撑。\n\n第1章**WebGL 基础**从图形渲染管线出发，讲解 WebGL 的核心概念，包括着色器与 GLSL 编程、缓冲区与纹理映射、相机与投影矩阵，为理解所有 Web 3D 技术打下坚实基础。\n\n第2章**Three.js 实战**聚焦当前最主流的 Web 3D 框架，从场景搭建到材质光照，从动画控制到性能调优，带你掌握 Three.js 的完整开发流程与最佳实践。\n\n第3章**数据可视化**系统介绍 D3.js、ECharts 等可视化工具的核心用法，深入对比 SVG 与 Canvas 的技术选型，并通过交互式仪表盘案例串联实战经验。\n\n第4章**Canvas 与 SVG 进阶**深入浏览器原生 2D 图形能力，涵盖 Canvas 2D API 高级用法、SVG 动画技术、离屏渲染与游戏级 Canvas 渲染优化。\n\n第5章**WebGPU 入门**面向下一代 Web 图形标准，介绍 WebGPU 的架构设计、计算着色器编程，以及与 WebGL 的对比和典型应用场景，帮助你提前布局未来技术。\n\n建议学习路径：先从第1章掌握 WebGL 底层原理，然后通过第2章学习 Three.js 的上层抽象，再根据实际需求选择第3章的数据可视化方向或第4章的 2D 图形进阶。对前沿技术感兴趣的读者可以在此基础上学习第5章的 WebGPU 内容。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"webgl-fundamentals","title":"WebGL 基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/webgl-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"webgl-overview","title":"WebGL 概述与渲染管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/webgl-fundamentals/webgl-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"shaders-and-glsl","title":"着色器与 GLSL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/webgl-fundamentals/shaders-and-glsl"},{"seq":3,"slug":"buffers-and-textures","title":"缓冲区与纹理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/webgl-fundamentals/buffers-and-textures"},{"seq":4,"slug":"camera-and-projection","title":"相机与投影","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/webgl-fundamentals/camera-and-projection"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"threejs-practice","title":"Three.js 实战","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/threejs-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"threejs-scene-setup","title":"场景搭建与基础对象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/threejs-practice/threejs-scene-setup"},{"seq":2,"slug":"materials-and-lighting","title":"材质与光照","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/threejs-practice/materials-and-lighting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"animation-and-controls","title":"动画与交互控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/threejs-practice/animation-and-controls"},{"seq":4,"slug":"threejs-performance","title":"Three.js 性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/threejs-practice/threejs-performance"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-visualization","title":"数据可视化","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/data-visualization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"d3-fundamentals","title":"D3.js 基础与数据绑定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/data-visualization/d3-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"echarts-practice","title":"ECharts 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/data-visualization/echarts-practice"},{"seq":3,"slug":"svg-canvas-comparison","title":"SVG 与 Canvas 对比选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/data-visualization/svg-canvas-comparison"},{"seq":4,"slug":"interactive-dashboard","title":"交互式仪表盘设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/data-visualization/interactive-dashboard"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"canvas-svg-advanced","title":"Canvas 与 SVG 进阶","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/canvas-svg-advanced","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"canvas-2d-api","title":"Canvas 2D API 深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/canvas-svg-advanced/canvas-2d-api"},{"seq":2,"slug":"svg-animation","title":"SVG 动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/canvas-svg-advanced/svg-